      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    par_value = 100\n    coupon_rate = 0.03\n    market_rate = 0.05\n    years_to_maturity = 3\n    payments_per_year = 2\n\n    period_rate = market_rate / payments_per_year\n    coupon_payment = (coupon_rate / payments_per_year) * par_value\n    total_payments = years_to_maturity * payments_per_year\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    pv_coupons = sum(\n        coupon_payment / ((1 + period_rate) ** (t + 1))\n        for t in range(total_payments)\n    )\n    pv_principal = par_value / ((1 + period_rate) ** total_payments)\n    bond_price = pv_coupons + pv_principal\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(bond_price, 3)\n```",
